      "start_seconds": 276.43,
      "end_seconds": 297.16,
      "duration_seconds": 20.73,
      "text": "hm okay try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing and bring it to the next visit i'll also refer you to the emergency team one warning sign to remember: you cannot go now in that case don't wait"
    },
    {
